     _/_e_t_c_/_a_u_t_h_p_f_/_a_u_t_h_p_f_._m_e_s_s_a_g_e.  This message may be a screen-full of the ap‐
     propriate use policy, the contents of _/_e_t_c_/_m_o_t_d or something as simple as
     the following:

           This means you will be held accountable by the powers that be
           for traffic originating from your machine, so please play nice.

     To tell the user where to go when the system is broken,
